# AGENTS.md

**Stack**: Astro 5.x · TypeScript · Bun

## Rules

- Content bodies (prose below frontmatter) are human-written only — NEVER write, rewrite, or expand them. This is a personal site, not an agent content farm
- Agents MAY: create stub content files (frontmatter only, empty body), edit frontmatter fields, run schema migrations across frontmatter
- Agents MAY NOT: author or edit body prose in `src/content/**`, even when stubbing a new entry — leave the body empty for the human to fill
- Import aliases: `@components/*`, `@assets/*`, `@layouts/*` — enforce in tsconfig.json
- Astro components: `.astro` extension required

## Workflow

- Commands: `bun run dev|build|preview|lint|format`
- Run `bun run lint` + `bun run format:check` before declaring work complete
